      "name": "Connecting and testing servers",
      "what": "Live status follows a local server's connection; an unreachable server reports failure and remains available to retry.",
      "reach": "A configured server's Connect, Disconnect and Test buttons; Refresh MCP status on the grid.",
      "proof": "A local JSON-RPC server connects, tests and disconnects; a refused connection and failed refresh report errors without losing the configuration.",
